          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Keep ye judgment, and do justice: for my salvation",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "near to come, and my righteousness to be revealed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Blessed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "doeth this, and the son of man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "layeth hold on it; that keepeth the sabbath from polluting it, and keepeth his hand from doing any evil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Neither let the son of the stranger, that hath joined himself to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", speak, saying, The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath utterly separated me from his people: neither let the eunuch say, Behold, I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a dry tree.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto the eunuchs that keep my sabbaths, and choose",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "the things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that please me, and take hold of my covenant;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even unto them will I give in mine house and within my walls a place and a name better than of sons and of daughters: I will give them an everlasting name, that shall not be cut off.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also the sons of the stranger, that join themselves to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", to serve him, and to love the name of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", to be his servants, every one that keepeth the sabbath from polluting it, and taketh hold of my covenant;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even them will I bring to my holy mountain, and make them joyful in my house of prayer: their burnt offerings and their sacrifices",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "accepted upon mine altar; for mine house shall be called an house of prayer for all people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "which gathereth the outcasts of Israel saith, Yet will I gather",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "others",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to him, beside those that are gathered unto him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ All ye beasts of the field, come to devour,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "yea",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", all ye beasts in the forest.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His watchmen",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "blind: they are all ignorant, they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all dumb dogs, they cannot bark; sleeping, lying down, loving to slumber.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "they are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "greedy dogs",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "can never have enough, and they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shepherds",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cannot understand: they all look to their own way, every one for his gain, from his quarter.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Come ye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "say they",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", I will fetch wine, and we will fill ourselves with strong drink; and to morrow shall be as this day,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.56.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.56.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "much more abundant.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
